          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/wayne-heim-western-fine-art-photography" style="color:#8b5a2b; text-decoration:underline;">About the Artist</a> — 
            <span style="color:#666;">Background and approach</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p>Western fine art photography, at its best, invites the viewer past the familiar and into something specific — a person, a story, a moment that belongs to no one else. The work does not explain itself. It asks to be entered.</p>

      </article>
